=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Glowing Hearth} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (H-6) near Homepoint #1 for a cutscene.
** During the cutscene, you will be transported inside of the {z:Silver Knife} zone.
* Speak with {n:Oscarnot} inside for a cutscene.
** **If the bidding closes for the Auria Collection you will need to talk to {n:Zemerine} before talking to {n:Gama-Shama}.**
* Speak with {n:Gama-Shama} in the {z:Silver Knife}. He will mention how it was hard to procure his {i:Esthete's Masque|Esthete's Masque|23807} and how he obtained his attire from {n:Runje Desaali}.
* Speak to {n:Runje Desaali} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (J-10) until she shows you the {i:Esthete's Masque|Esthete's Masque|23807} and hint at wanting some specific equipment that is in high demand.
** Quickest from the Castle Adoulin gates waypoint.
* Make sure you get the dialogue about the mask **before you trade or you will need a new item**.
* Trade her an Item Level 106 or 115 {p:Wildskeeper Reive} Weapon, Armor, or Rare/Ex Accessory. She will give you 4000 or 6000 Bayld depending on the item and the cutscene will continue.
** It may be worth looking to see if you have a {@i:Kupon AW-WK|8731} {i:Kupon AW-WK|Kupon AW-WK|8731} or {@k} {k:Mog Kupon AW-WK} already, before participating in a {p:Wildskeeper Reive}.
** {p:Records of Eminence} NPCs can also trade all 6 Wildkeeper Reive Key Items for a weapon.
* After trading in any applicable item, she then unlocks new shop items. Ask her **What does Geosuke recommend?**.
* Buy a {@i:Esthete's Masque|23807} {i:Esthete's Masque|Esthete's Masque|23807}, {@i:Esthete's Coat|23808} {i:Esthete's Coat|Esthete's Coat|23808} and {@i:Esthete's Hose|23809} {i:Esthete's Hose|Esthete's Hose|23809} from {n:Runje Desaali}.
** Each piece is 30,000 {p:Bayld}. You need all 3 for 90,000 {p:Bayld} to continue.
* Return to the {z:Silver Knife} and speak to {n:Zemerine} with all items equipped or the set as a Lockstyle for a cutscene.
** Other lockstyles cannot be used.
** If this cutscene does not play, attempt the next step by removing the equipment and talking to Oscarnot. {p:Discussion Page|Talk:The Voracious Resurgence Mission 9-3}
* Unequip the items or disable your lockstyle, then speak with {n:Oscarnot} for another cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Glowing Hearth} outside of the {z:Silver Knife} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} for a cutscene and reward.

